    "text": "Here the reactivity order is<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0064_5af11eb7aa5e.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.64167in;height:1.35833in\" /><br />(I) becomes aromatic after removal of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br />(II) becomes non aromatic after removal of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br />(III) becomes anti aromatic after removal of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>"
